# Vercel only needs to build the Node API in api/. Ignore the MkDocs site and
# all the Python so Vercel doesn't mis-detect this as a Python project.
# (The website itself is served by GitHub Pages, not Vercel.)

# Python / MkDocs site
*.py
agent/
content/
docs/
site/
personal-docs/
mkdocs.yml
requirements.txt
__pycache__/

# Batch / shell helpers
*.bat
*.ps1
*.sh

# Docs & misc
*.md
!DEPLOY.md
.github/
.kiro/
*.pem
